linux-software-uninstaller (2.2.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * English is now the main and default interface language.
  * Polish translation; language can be chosen in Settings
    (English, Polski or Automatic = system language).
  * Root helper messages follow the interface language.
  * Backup files renamed: packages.txt, config.tar.gz, other.txt,
    restore.sh; activity log renamed to activity.log (migrated
    automatically).
  * README.Debian and package description in English.

 -- Linux Software Uninstaller <linux-software-uninstaller@localhost>  Sun, 22 Nov 2026 05:50:00 +0100

linux-software-uninstaller (2.1.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Renamed from "Deinstalator" to "Linux Software Uninstaller".
    Replaces the old "deinstalator" package.
  * New paths: /usr/bin/linux-software-uninstaller,
    ~/.config/linux-software-uninstaller,
    /var/backups/linux-software-uninstaller.

 -- Linux Software Uninstaller <linux-software-uninstaller@localhost>  Sun, 22 Nov 2026 05:40:00 +0100

deinstalator (2.0.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * New interface: sidebar, statistics cards, list with icons, details
    panel, light and dark theme.
  * Root helper started through polkit.
  * Backup before uninstalling: snapper, btrfs, Timeshift or a package
    configuration backup.
  * "Cleanup" page with "Clean up everything".
  * .deb package with icon, menu entry and AppStream metadata.

 -- Deinstalator <deinstalator@localhost>  Sun, 22 Nov 2026 05:30:00 +0100

